# Fragment Animations

This presentation demonstrates **fragment animations** for incremental reveals.

Use the simple `{animate: "effect"}` syntax!

===

# Basic Fragments

::: {animate: "fade-in"}
This text will fade in
:::

::: {animate: "fade-in"}
This text will also fade in (on next step)
:::

::: {animate: "fade-in"}
And this one too!
:::

===

# Fragment Styles

::: {animate: "fade-out"}
This will fade out
:::

::: {animate: "fade-up"}
This will slide up while fading in
:::

::: {animate: "highlight-red"}
This will turn red
:::

::: {animate: "grow"}
This will grow
:::

===

# More Fragment Effects

::: {animate: "fade-in-then-out"}
Fade in, then out
:::

::: {animate: "fade-in-then-semi-out"}
Fade in, then semi out
:::

::: {animate: "shrink"}
This will shrink
:::

::: {animate: "strike"}
This will be struck through
:::

===

# Highlight Effects

::: {animate: "highlight-blue"}
Highlight blue
:::

::: {animate: "highlight-green"}
Highlight green
:::

::: {animate: "highlight-current-red"}
Highlight red, then back
:::

::: {animate: "semi-fade-out"}
Semi fade out (50%)
:::

===

# Nested Fragments

::: {animate: "fade-in"}
::: {animate: "highlight-red"}
::: {animate: "semi-fade-out"}
Fade in > Turn red > Semi fade out
:::
:::
:::

===

# Multiple Effects

You can combine multiple effects in one animation:

::: {animate: "fade-up highlight-blue"}
This fades up AND turns blue!
:::

::: {animate: "grow highlight-green"}
This grows AND turns green!
:::

===

# Custom Order

::: {animate: "fade-in" index: 3}
Appears last (index 3)
:::

::: {animate: "fade-in" index: 1}
Appears first (index 1)
:::

::: {animate: "fade-in" index: 2}
Appears second (index 2)
:::

===

# Fragment Lists

Unordered list with fragments:

::: {animate: "fade-in"}
- First item
- Second item
:::

::: {animate: "fade-in"}
- Third item
- Fourth item
:::

===

# Mixed Content

::: {animate: "fade-in"}
## This header appears first
:::

::: {animate: "highlight-blue"}
This paragraph appears second and turns blue
:::

::: {animate: "fade-up"}
![Demo Image](https://placehold.co/400x300)
:::

===

# Code with Fragments

::: {animate: "fade-in"}
```javascript
function hello() {
    console.log("This code appears first");
}
```
:::

::: {animate: "highlight-green"}
The code will appear, then this text turns green!
:::

